@title Commissioning: Wire test tab lists wires in wiring order, a bad reading becomes a punch item
@area Commissioning
# Test as you build: expected values per wire, a reading entered, a miss opens a punch item, unmeasured wires stay red.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-lesson.novo
wait 20
click_text Commissioning
wait 20
click_text Test
wait 10
expect "not a compliance test record"
expect "not tested yet"
shot wire-test-start
check_layout
click_text "Open circuit"
wait 10
expect "MISS"
expect "punch open"
shot wire-test-miss
check_layout
click_text Punch
wait 10
expect "Continuity failed"
shot wire-test-punch
check_layout
